<title>BRAZIL: Brazil January trade deficit at $413 mln.</title>
<headline>Brazil January trade deficit at $413 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil posted a $413 million trade deficit in January which included fuel imports not registered in its computer system, the Ministry of Industry and Commerce said.</p>
<p>The Ministry said in a statement that exports were $3.685 billion, and imports $4.098 billion.</p>
</text>
